==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[get with the programme]] {{qualifier|UK}}

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[get with]] [[the]] [[program]]}}

# To become [[organized]], current, or aware. {{rfex}}
# To work productively toward the objective of a shared enterprise, especially after the objective or the environment has changed.
#: ''Though natural gas prices dropped, the folks doing solar didn't '''get with the program'''.
# To comply with the norms of a social group, especially a shared enterprise.
#: ''Dude, '''get with the program'''! We don't do casual Fridays any more.''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|become aware}} [[get a clue]] 
* {{sense|become organized}} be [[on top of]] things
* get/be [[on the same page]]

